":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}},{"text":"위로","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"1","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위로","audio":"/audio/3fd4bdbe77c71ceac16d.mp3"}},{"text":"올라가야","meaning":"上，上去","explanation":"올라가다：上，上去；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"1","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올라가야","audio":"/audio/5c9d9e221ffa7a26b40d.mp3"}},{"text":"있습니다.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있습니다","audio":"/audio/de7385b84e32dd836700.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab367eb9a60ab986","term":"산","zh":"山","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3","entryId":"20954","definition":"比平地高耸出很多，大多有着树木、草、石头等的土地。","pronunciation":["산"]},{"id":"e0bebb354d8f7f3b","term":"위","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3","entryId":"71462","definition":"比某基准更高的一方；或指比中间更高的一方。","pronunciation":["위"]},{"id":"bfc58fbbb2f76325","term":"올라가다","zh":"上，上去","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3","entryId":"89867","definition":"从下向上，从低处前往高处。","pronunciation":["올라가다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/aebff0244fc9a8767d97.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.577,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71462","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/k